w Knight) and Mariya Anastasova (Baldur's Gate 3).</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3094210/extras/6e1660f74bce386eac83219d9ae76b00.poster.avif?t=1760056797\" width=780 height=316 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3094210/extras/6e1660f74bce386eac83219d9ae76b00.webm?t=1760056797\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3094210/extras/6e1660f74bce386eac83219d9ae76b00.mp4?t=1760056797\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Smash Attack Aus"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3094210/aad001afeff73493527371b380613ee140885280/header.jpg?t=1760056797","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 Smash Attack Aus & Freedom Games - All Rights Reserved","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3094210/317852735/98efc1053743c98fb93adfcf533131f861e0191e/1760056022/dash_av1.mpd?t=1760056794","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3094210/317852735/98efc1053743c98fb93adfcf533131f861e0191e/1760056022/dash_h264.mpd?t=1760056794","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3094210/317852735/98efc1053743c98fb93adfcf533131f861e0191e/1760056022/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1760056794","id":257215205,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257215205/movie480.mp4?t=1760056794","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257215205/movie_max.mp4?t=1760056794"},"name":"PLAY THE DEMO","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257215205/6597f431b50bcf215a71